    if [word], rests on, [other]
    and [word], is, used

[word], breaks, Every word is used
    if [word], is, a word
    and not [word], is, used

a word nobody uses, adds line, spec.plain, "a, is, lonely"
a word nobody uses, must break, Every word is used

